  "id": "tubal-ligation",
  "term": "tubal ligation",
  "definition": "Tubal ligation is a permanent contraceptive method that provides highly effective, long-term pregnancy prevention with little ongoing user involvement. In this context, it is intended for people who do not want additional children and differs from reversible long-acting methods because it is an irreversible choice.",
